GiraffeFitFun Privacy Policy​
Last Updated: [2025/04/30]​
Use of Non-Personal Information​
While GiraffeFitFun does not collect personal information, we may collect non-personal data, including device information, your interactions with the AI - generated workout plans (such as which types of plans you access more frequently), app usage patterns like the time of day you typically use the app, and other aggregated or anonymous data. This data serves the sole purpose of enhancing the app’s functionality, refining the AI algorithms for more accurate and personalized workout generation, and overall improving your user experience and the app’s performance.​
Sharing of Information​
Since we do not collect any personal information, we do not share, sell, or rent such data with third parties. However, we may share non-personal data with third-party service providers, including analytics firms and AI technology partners. These collaborations help us better understand how users engage with the app’s AI workout generation features and identify areas for improvement. The third-party service providers we work with are bound by strict privacy policies and agreements. These agreements strictly prohibit them from using the data for any purpose other than assisting us in enhancing GiraffeFitFun.​
Security​
As we do not collect personal information, our security measures are mainly focused on protecting non-personal data. Nevertheless, we implement reasonable security practices to safeguard the data we collect. This includes using encryption techniques to secure data during transmission and storage, as well as maintaining secure server environments. We regularly review and update our security protocols to ensure the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of the non-personal data we handle, especially data related to the operation of our AI - based workout planning system.​
Changes to this Policy​
We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in our operational practices, technological advancements, or legal requirements. In the event of significant changes, we will notify you by displaying a prominent notice within the app or through other appropriate communication channels. We encourage you to review this policy regularly to stay informed about our privacy practices.​
Contact Information​
If you have any questions, comments, or concerns regarding our Privacy Policy, please feel free to contact us at [812791840@qq.com]. We are committed to promptly addressing all inquiries and resolving any issues you may have.​
Please note that this Privacy Policy is subject to change at any time. However, given that GiraffeFitFun does not collect personal information, the probability of major changes to this policy remains relatively low.
